passwordReset.body:
Someone asked to reset the password of this account. To choose a new password, open this link within 30 minutes:
{{url}}

If it was not you, ignore this email; your password stays the same.

invitation.body:
You have been invited to join {{tenant}}. To accept, sign in or create an account with this email address and open:
{{url}}

The invitation is valid for 7 days.

trialEnding.body:
The Grower trial of {{tenant}} ends on {{date}}. To keep its limits, choose a plan in Settings, Plan and billing:
{{url}}

If you do nothing, the free plan applies. Nothing you recorded is hidden or deleted.

renewalFailed.body:
We could not collect the renewal for {{tenant}}. The payment gateway will try again. To keep the plan, pay or update the payment method by {{date}}:
{{url}}

After that date the free plan applies; nothing is hidden or deleted.
